https://www.morfrac.com/about,https://www.morfrac.com/about,200,0.47,,About | MORFRAC,15,"Innovating the yachting industry with smart, reliable, customizable hardware. Learn where MORFRAC comes from and where is headed!",129,https://www.morfrac.com/about,,True,general,medium,medium,medium,low,2,MORFRAC,10,953,"Skip to Content Follow us Click here to setup your social networks 0 My Cart 0 Wishlist Sign in HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Shop Now! 0 0 HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Follow us Click here to setup your social networks Sign in Shop Now! MORFRAC Complexity, made simple. Welcome aboard! At MORFRAC , we know you’re looking for solutions that
not only work but also feel effortless and intuitive. Imagine having the
confidence that your challenges can be tackled in a way that feels like it should
have always been this simple. That’s where we come in. We offer a wide range of products and services tailored to
your unique needs, whether you're seeking innovative design, precise
manufacturing, or comprehensive turnkey projects. Our team is dedicated to
understanding your vision and turning it into reality. When you partner with us, you’ll benefit from our
cutting-edge technology and high-quality materials, ensuring that every
solution is durable and performs at the highest level. With our turnkey
projects, we handle every detail from concept to completion, so you can focus
on what truly matters: your goals and your passion for sailing. Embark on your journey with us Imagine a sailing experience that’s smoother, safer, and
simply more enjoyable. Since our launch of the morfblock. in 2017, we’ve
committed ourselves to creating solutions that fit your needs perfectly,
empowering you to get the most out of every journey. Our patented morfblock. , powerfurl. furling systems, and range of smart accessories, like low-friction rings,
padeyes, dogbones, and shackles, are all designed to make life on-board easier.
Each piece combines high performance with seamless functionality, so you can
focus on what you love: the thrill and freedom of sailing. Expertise tailored to you Located in the vibrant city of Valencia, Spain , our
facilities are perfectly positioned to offer direct, on-water support for your
yacht. If your project requires, we also have an
extensive network of trusted partner yards to accommodate any need. Our team collaborates with top sailors and industry experts
to bring you the best in yachting technology, delivering turnkey hardware
solutions , engineering support, and streamlined design-to-manufacturing
processes . Whether you’re a shipyard, yacht designer, project manager, or
passionate sailor, we tailor each solution to your goals; ensuring precision,
quality, and ease every step of the way. Our commitment, your values At MORFRAC, we deeply share your dedication to responsible business practices and environmental sustainability. We prioritize ethical working conditions and strive to use recycled and recyclable materials whenever possible, ensuring that our operations reflect your values. But we don't stop at crafting exceptional products. We actively support local sports events and young sailors, fostering a collaborative environment that nurtures smart, innovative entrepreneurship. Together, we can create a positive impact on the sailing community and the planet, making every journey not just about adventure, but also about responsibility and growth. Join us in shaping the future of yachting We’re thrilled to be part of your yachting journey! At
MORFRAC, we believe in the power of collaboration to create exceptional
experiences on the water. Let’s work together to innovate and elevate your
sailing adventures. Together, we can shape the future of yachting! We partnered with MORFRAC for the development, design and testing of our
Semi Rigid Wing system, including a number of details of the Mast and the wing
trimming systems based on their ultra-light morfblocks. We trust in a long-lasting
cooperation and we count on them to bring our technology to the wider sailing
community. Having worked closely together we can vouch for their knowledge,
trustworthiness and their high quality and ethical standards. Greg Johnston • Advanced Wing Systems ​ official supplier of the NYYC American Magic for the 36th America's Cup It is always a pleasure to work with the MORFRAC team. A young
company with plenty of talent and exquisite service. We have been involved in a
number of projects together and they proved to be very flexible and ensured high-quality
deliverables. With MORFRAC you can expect a request to be completed thoroughly,
in a timely fashion and according to your expectation. It is easy to work
together with them, share ideas, discuss projects, explore solutions. Keep it
up, boys! Micky Costa • Performance Yachts Project Manager Thanks to MORFRAC help, I managed to get the boat dressed and ready to
participate in the 2020 RORC Transatlantic Race in a very tight timeframe. The guys
