 your next endeavor with expertly crafted, reliable solutions. get in​​​​spired.​​​​ solutions. [ manufacture ] Expertise in Manufacturing Excellence At MORFRAC, we believe that creating the perfect product starts with a deep understanding of manufacturing. Our expertise in production techniques and material characteristics allows us to improve and refine each component to meet the highest standards of quality and functionality. With this knowledge, we offer expert guidance to ensure your parts are manufactured precisely to fit your project’s requirements and timeline. Whatever your needs, we’re here to help you achieve optimal results, on schedule and to specification. ​ Manufacturing according to specifications. Design improvement for manufacturing. Batch production optimization. Turnkey solutions: Plug n Play Specialized materials. Composites solutions. [ manufacturing ] Expertise in Manufacturing Excellence At Morfrac, we believe that creating the perfect product starts with a deep understanding of manufacturing. Our expertise in production techniques and material characteristics allows us to improve and refine each component to meet the highest standards of quality and functionality. With this knowledge, we offer expert guidance to ensure your parts are manufactured precisely to fit your project’s requirements and timeline. Whatever your needs, we’re here to help you achieve optimal results, on schedule and to specification. ​ Manufacturing according to specifications. Design improvement for manufacturing. Batch production optimization. Turnkey solutions: Plug n Play Specialized materials. Composites Precision you can trust . At MORFRAC, we understand that precision is everything. With high-quality machining that meets the strictest standards, we’re here to provide you with parts you can trust, perfectly tailored, plug-and-play solutions that simplify your setup. By combining advanced technology with naval architecture expertise, MORFRAC ensures flawless performance every time, so you can focus on what matters most: the journey ahead. Expertise tailored to you . For your project, only the best will do. That’s why we bring unmatched expertise in marine and aerospace-grade materials, selecting ideal components and precision techniques just for you. With in-house prototyping, custom manufacturing, and a network of specialized partners, we handle even the most complex projects with accuracy and consistency. Count on MORFRAC to deliver dependable quality, so you can set sail with confidence and focus on the journey ahead. Follow every step. With MORFRAC’s online portal, you’re in control from start to finish. Track your orders' progress anytime, anywhere, from design through to delivery, for a transparent and seamless experience. You’ll stay informed at every stage, leaving you free to enjoy a stress-free build or refit journey. Explore our recent projects to see how we’ve revolutionized manufacturing, making it simple and problem-free. get in​​​​spired.​​​​ close up. MORFRAC . [solutions] Your Dynamic Snippet will be displayed here... This message is displayed because you did not provided both a filter and a template to use. just for you. morfblock. [custom]​​​​ powerfurl. [custom] YOUR WAY morfblock. [custom]​​​​ powerfurl. [custom] YOUR WAY much more. dogbone. Aluminium and Titanium dogbones. Available in 10 sizes Ti-shackle. Titanium d-shackle  Strong and light. Available in 3 sizes morfring. Hard-anodized Aluminum + PTFE Available in 10 sizes padeye. Stick-on / Ring-on / Through-deck padeyes powerfurl. Outstanding furling systems 1,5t to 12t SWL solutions. You imagine, We make it true! custom. Make it your way! morfblock. High-load & low-weight sailing blocks 125kg - 15t SWL ​ Where we are Camì del Canal 91 Local 13 · ​ Valencia Mar 4 6024 · Valencia · Spain Call us +34 676 302 314 Send us a message info@morfrac.com Stay in touch Consent Preferences Home • About us • Shop B​LOCK • FURLER • PADEYE • LOW FRICTION RING • SHA