as seen in the pignose fitting in the photo above, while Grade 5 is perfect for the raw power of Mini Maxis and similar high-performance yachts. Our skills extend to producing bespoke pignose fittings and other yacht hardware, tailored precisely to our client specifications. Whether you provide the design or need us to develop something custom, we take pride in delivering products that are not only engineered to perfection but also arrive on time, ready to perform. At MORFRAC, reliability isn’t just a promise, it’s a standard we live by. Every detail matters, and we ensure each component is crafted to meet the high standrads of the yachting world. Choosing MORFRAC means choosing a partner who understands your passion for sailing and the importance of performance and durability. With our expertise, your yacht will be equipped with the finest components, designed to keep you ahead of the competition. ​ solutions.[manufacture] in CUSTOM # manufacturing Labels manufacturing Archive All dates January
