https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/2024-what-a-year-32,https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/2024-what-a-year-32,200,0.47,,2024... What a year! | MORFRAC,30,"Nearly time to turn the page on a new promising year.
A bit of a summary. See you in 2025!",90,https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/2024-what-a-year-32,,True,technical_blog,medium,high,medium,low,2,2024... What a year!,9,1202,"Skip to Content Follow us Click here to setup your social networks 0 My Cart 0 Wishlist Sign in HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Shop Now! 0 0 HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Follow us Click here to setup your social networks Sign in Shop Now! 2024... What a year! Nearly time to turn the page on a new promising year. 21 December 2024 by MORFRAC SYSTEMS S.L., Raffaele De Rose 2024 is almost over. Wow, it went fast! With 112 projects under our belt , this year has been one of non-stop activity, achievements, and solid progress for MORFRAC . 

We’ve focused on doing what we do best: staying true to our craft, earning and keeping the trust of our clients, and steadily expanding our products and services with the needs of fellow sailors at heart . A big year for powerfurl. Our powerfurl. range had some standout moments this year. The spotlight shone on powerfurl.[one] , the smallest in the family and one of the best-sellers together with the powerfurl.[three] in its single-line drum version. These updates have reinforced powerfurl.'s reputation for precision, reliability and performance. morfblock. - Simple yet sophisticated Once ​again, the morfblock. proved its versatility, with a bunch of custom projects tailored especially for medium-to-large yachts. 
With materials like carbon and titanium , we’ve achieved incredibly low weights and top-notch performance (all at an unbeatable price point, that must be said too!). morfblocks offer simplicity, strength, and reliability, making them the top choice for demanding setups. A new face for MORFRAC online 2024 also saw the launch of our brand-new webpage and a completely revamped webshop at www.morfrac.com/shop . Designed to be more user-friendly, intuitive, and visually engaging, it’s now easier than ever for sailors and business clients to explore our products, learn about our services, and place orders seamlessly. Get exactly what you need with just a few clicks! Hardware that delivers This year, we’ve produced thousands of morfrings. and dogbones. , many of them personalised to meet the unique needs of our clients. Whether shaped, branded, or crafted from custom materials, these components have found their way onto both high-performance racing yachts and local cruisers. Supporting all types of projects From TP52s, Mini Maxis, and superyachts to local cruising boats, we’ve been hard at work enhancing performance and solving problems for a diverse range of vessels. No matter the size or scope, every project has been guaranteed our full attention to detail and a commitment to delivering nothing but the best. Design-to-Manufacturing : the full package This year has highlighted the strength of our design & manufacturing solutions . The projects have been as varied as they come: rudders, propellers, keels, bulbs, water ballast systems, moulds, pignoses... to name a few! But it’s not just about what we’ve engineered or produced; it’s how we’ve done it. 
For our client's complete peace of mind , we handle everything: from crafting bespoke designs and preparing production drawings to reverse-engineering and providing real-time project updates. METSTRADE and the morfwing. November brought another successful outing at METSTRADE in Amsterdam. Great show, as usual, and we officially launched the morfwing. A semi-rigid, twin-skinned wing on a rotating mast, designed for you to 
sail higher and faster, experiencing superior upwind precision and exceptional downwind speeds, all while staying safely in control. We aim at bringing wing technology to all sailors . And the buzz at METS confirmed that we are on the good path! Supporting the spirit of Sailing Our support for the Mini 6.50 Palma-Melilla-Palma Regatta has been one of the most fulfilling parts of the year. An amazing regatta, featuring 34 boats in strong winds and high seas! By sponsoring such an event and nurturing young sailors, we wanted to contribute growing the culture and values of sailing , and inspiring the next generation of sailors. To celebrate, we awarded prizes to top finishers and offered discount vouchers to all participants, reinforcing the camaraderie that define the sport of sailing. Looking ahead. As we reflect on the year, we’re truly proud of what we’ve achieved . We’re ready to face the new year head-on. Wheth​er it’s innovative hardware, bespoke solutions, or supporting the sport we love, we’ll continue to deliver with passion and precision . Here’s to another year of steady growth and and continuing to deliver excellence for sailors on the 7 seas! See you on the water in 2025!​ in ​NEWS Labels Archive All dates April
