https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/new-powerfurl-one-38,https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/new-powerfurl-one-38,200,0.38,,¡The new 𝗽𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿𝗳𝘂𝗿𝗹.[𝗼𝗻𝗲]! | MORFRAC,35,"Discover the new powerfurl. [one] – now with titanium parts, ceramic bearings, and 8mm rope capacity. Compact, lightweight, and ready to sail.",142,https://www.morfrac.com/blog/news-1/new-powerfurl-one-38,,True,technical_blog,medium,high,medium,low,2,New 𝗽𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿𝗳𝘂𝗿𝗹.[𝗼𝗻𝗲] just landed!,9,755,"Skip to Content Follow us Click here to setup your social networks 0 My Cart 0 Wishlist Sign in HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Shop Now! 0 0 HOME MORFRAC PRODUCTS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUTIONS SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACT Follow us Click here to setup your social networks Sign in Shop Now! New 𝗽𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿𝗳𝘂𝗿𝗹.[𝗼𝗻𝗲] just landed! Compact Power, Upgraded 14 May 2025 by MORFRAC SYSTEMS S.L., Raffaele De Rose Say hello to the new generation of compact furlers. The upgraded 
powerfurl.[one]

takes everything you loved about the original and pushes it further, both in design and performance. Whether you're racing offshore or cruising short-handed, every gram and every second counts. That's why we’ve re-engineered our smallest furler with full titanium shaft, pins, and fittings , ensuring unmatched strength and corrosion resistance at the lightest possible weight. Quick opening systems on both the furler and swivel now make operations faster and smoother. The redesigned fork offers improved width and depth , meaning it now fits all major furling cable terminals . Compatibility issues? Not anymore. You’re free to choose the torsion cable you want, or use our thimbles to enjoy the torsion rope you like. Inside, full-ceramic bearings keep your system running ultra-smooth under load, and reduce maintenance to the minimum. The w ider drum line-guide now accepts up to 8mm rope , offering better grip and handling with thicker furling lines. It’s still compact, still beautifully made. But now it’s faster, stronger, and more versatile. Whether you’re a performance sailor or a weekend adventurer, the new powerfurl.[one] is ready to deliver. Ready to upgrade? 🛒Get yours now from our online shop: GET YOUR powerfurl.[one] NOW! in ​NEWS Labels Archive All dates April
