https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/blog-1/morfrac-de-walle-sails-33,https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/blog-1/morfrac-de-walle-sails-33,200,0.36,,powerfurl. and morfblock. @ de Walle Sails NL,45,"MORFRAC's powerfurl., morfblock. and deck solutions available from  5 April 2025 at a new Dutch sail loft led by Kees de Walle.",127,https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/blog-1/morfrac-de-walle-sails-33,,True,technical_blog,medium,high,medium,low,2,MORFRAC joins the launch of de Walle Sails,9,821,"Ir al contenido Síganos Click here to setup your social networks 0 Mi Carrito 0 Lista de deseos Identificarse INICIO NOSOTROS PRODUCTOS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUCIONES SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACTOS ¡Compra ahora! 0 0 INICIO NOSOTROS PRODUCTOS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUCIONES SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACTOS Síganos Click here to setup your social networks Identificarse ¡Compra ahora! MORFRAC joins the launch of de Walle Sails MORFRAC furling systems and deck solutions will be available at a new Dutch sail loft led by ocean advocate and sailor Kees de Walle. 25 de marzo de 2025 por MORFRAC SYSTEMS S.L., Raffaele De Rose On
5 April 2025, a new sail loft will open its doors in the heart of Enkhuizen. de
Walle Sails, founded by renowned sailor and sustainability advocate Kees de
Walle, will offer custom sailmaking services to a growing community of racers,
cruisers and offshore sailors in the region. MORFRAC
is proud to support the launch of this new venture with a selection of our
products, including our flagship furling system powerfurl. , smart morfblock .,
and a selection of our deck hardware. The opening day will provide a chance for
visitors to see and handle our equipment on site, and to receive professional
guidance from the de Walle Sails team on choosing the ideal setup for their
sailing programme. We
value placing our products in the hands of experienced sailors. Collaborating
with a loft like de Walle Sails, founded on both technical expertise and
long-term vision, aligns perfectly with our commitment to quality, performance,
and responsible innovation. The values that Kees represents, further reinforce
this alignment, connecting sailing with education, ocean health, and the next
generations. As
always, we design our products to work hand in hand with high-performance
sails. A good sail deserves a great companion: and that’s where powerfurl. makes the difference. We
extend our best wishes and fair winds to Kees and the entire de Walle Sails
team. We are confident this new venture will become a reference point in Dutch
sailmaking, and we look forward to seeing our gear in action with their sails! For
more information: kees@dewalle ​ sails.nl en BLOG # morfrac network news partners powerfurl. Etiquetas morfrac network news partners powerfurl. Archivar Todas las fechas abril
