https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/stories-4,https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/historias-4,200,0.44,,HISTORIAS | MORFRAC,19,,0,https://www.morfrac.com/es/blog/historias-4,,True,technical_blog,medium,high,medium,low,1,,9,589,"Ir al contenido Síganos Click here to setup your social networks 0 Mi Carrito 0 Lista de deseos Identificarse INICIO NOSOTROS PRODUCTOS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUCIONES SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACTOS ¡Compra ahora! 0 0 INICIO NOSOTROS PRODUCTOS powerfurl. morfblock. padeye. morfwing. morfring. dogbone. Ti-shackle. custom. SOLUCIONES SHOP STORIES PARTNERS CONTACTOS Síganos Click here to setup your social networks Identificarse ¡Compra ahora! TODO CUSTOM HISTORIAS BLOG Moldes impresos en 3D Recientemente, nos embarcamos en un proyecto apasionante para uno de nuestros clientes: una solución a medida basada en moldes impresos en 3D . ¿El resultado? Un proceso preciso y eficiente que ahorró... 11 jun 2024 Padeye a medida Ah, December 15th! A time for festive cheer, mince pies, and… last-minute yacht projects? Indeed, while most were finalizing Christmas shopping, we found ourselves faced with a rather urgent request. ... 29 dic 2023 Hélice de proa When people hear we've worked on a 45m Wally yacht, they probably think it's about few blocks, a furling system or some custom deck hardware. But this project? It was on a completely different scale! ... 15 may 2023 We partnered with MORFRAC for the development, design and testing of our
Semi Rigid Wing system, including a number of details of the Mast and the wing
trimming systems based on their ultra-light morfblocks. We trust in a long-lasting
cooperation and we count on them to bring our technology to the wider sailing
community. Having worked closely together we can vouch for their knowledge,
trustworthiness and their high quality and ethical standards. Greg Johnston • Advanced Wing Systems ​ official supplier of the NYYC American Magic for the 36th America's Cup It is always a pleasure to work with the Morfrac Systems team. A young
company with plenty of talent and exquisite service. We have been involved in a
number of projects together and they proved to be very flexible and ensured high-quality
deliverables. With Morfrac you can expect a request to be completed thoroughly,
in a timely fashion and according to your expectation. It is easy to work
together with them, share ideas, discuss projects, explore solutions. Keep it
up, boys! Micky Costa • Performance Yachts Project Manager Thanks to MORFRAC help, I managed to get the boat dressed and ready to
participate in the 2020 RORC Transatlantic Race in a very tight timeframe. The guys
